'''''Fuscocephaloziopsis''''' is a genus of [[liverwort]]s belonging to the family [[Cephaloziaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=''Fuscocephaloziopsis'' Fulford |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2689160 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=22 June 2023 |language=en}}</ref> The genus has [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

